# Vendored / generated trees clang-format should never touch. Patterns use
# clang-format's own glob syntax (gitignore-flavored but NOT full gitignore —
# a bare name only matches at the exact depth given, so every entry needs an
# explicit **/ prefix to match at any depth and /** to match everything below
# it; verified against clang-format 22).
**/build/**
**/emsdk/**
**/node_modules/**
**/extern/**
**/.cache/**
